frontend

Technologies Used
--------------------

-vite -react
-tailwindcss
-shadcn ui

run:- npm run dev

steps
--------
1.app.jsx (react-router-dom)
2.components:-
-Navbar.jsx (dropdownmenu and modetoggle from shadcn ui)
-dark/light mode(theme) -index.css(shadcn --theming) -themeprovider.jsx, modetoggle.jsx, using themeprovider in main.jsx (shadcn -docs -darkmode)
-footer.jsx
-Hero.jsx
3.pages
-login page
-verify page
-Home page
-products page
-ProductPage byid + if admin(update product details and product images)
-Cart page
-checkout page
-payment page (create stripe session)
-orderProcessing page (verify payment with stripe session-id)
-Orders page
-admindashboard page (with admin components -homepage -orderspage -infopage)
4.context
-usercontext (using localstorage for email for login then cookies after verify for token)
-productContext
-cartcontext




